"Celena North University is a hero college in Apex, with a combat program and an arts department."
"Hannah Elber, Cly Zhao and Keiko Velra went to Celena North's hero school."
"Its memorial garden amphitheater has grass terraces, a concrete stage and an arch of vines."
"Names of fallen alumni carve themselves into its granite memorial stones as if by unseen fingers."
"The memorial garden has a rose trellis over a concrete bench and an ornamental pear tree."
"First-years attend services for alumni who die on duty, in formal military-style jackets."
"At memorials art students provide music and flowers, and all recite the school pledge."
"A campus bus runs through Celena North."
"Hannah Elber's memorial service was held in the memorial garden amphitheater."
"Hannah Elber's name is carved on a tall granite memorial stone in the garden."
"Lanterns hang from arching tree limbs in the memorial garden."
"A quad on the university campus has a curved metal statue."
"Cafeteria North, the university's main dining hall, serves both the university and CNH."
